                      ],
                    ),
                  ),
                  FilledButton.icon(
                    onPressed: _refresh,
                    icon: const Icon(Icons.sync_rounded, size: 19),
                    label: const Text('Atualizar agora'),
                    style: FilledButton.styleFrom(
                      padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(
